<title>JAPAN: Nippon Paint files bond shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Nippon Paint files bond shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Paint Co Ltd said on Tuesday that it had applied to the Finance Ministry for a shelf registration to issue up to 20 billion yen worth of corporate bonds.</p>
<p>The registration will be effective for two years from July 15, it said.</p>
</text>
